; Mark III / Master System port names for the Disassembler window, in
; Emulicious' .ports format: <hex port> <name> [in|out]; without a
; direction the name serves both. A file of the same name in a project's
; folder takes its place.

3E Port_MemoryControl out
3F Port_IOPortControl out

7E Port_VCounter in
7F Port_HCounter in
7F Port_PSG out

BE Port_VDPData
BF Port_VDPAddress out
BF Port_VDPStatus in

DC Port_IOPort1 in
DD Port_IOPort2 in

F0 Port_FMAddress out
F1 Port_FMData out
F2 Port_AudioControl
